        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "91dd46ec-f704-59ff-8342-83a07305e665",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Yakuza Kiwami, Yakuza 0\n- Places: Japan, Taiwan, Europe, North America\n- Systems: PlayStation 3, PlayStation 4\n\nFacts:\n- Yakuza 0 was released in Japan for PlayStation 3 and PlayStation 4 on March 12, 2015.\n- The Taiwanese version of Yakuza 0 was released in May 2015.\n- Yakuza Kiwami is the prequel installment after Yakuza 0 in release order.\n- Yakuza Kiwami was released exclusively on PlayStation 4 in Europe and North America in August 2017, similarly to Yakuza 0.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
